yle=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지역 우수기업과 청년인재</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대학생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업생등 취업준비생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">의 만남의 장을 통하여 기업정보도 취득하고 수상의 기회도 얻을 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기업별 탐방학생을 선착순 모집 중이오니 관심있는 분들의 많은 신청 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 